==Finnish==

===Etymology===
From earlier {{m|fi|inhiminen}} (compare {{m|fi|inhimillinen}}), from {{inh|fi|fiu-fin-pro|*inhiminen}}. {{unk|fi}} origin, perhaps from {{cog|ine-pro|*ǵenh₁-||kin}}. Cognate to {{cog|et|inimene}} and {{cog|krl|ihmini}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{fi-pronunciation|a=fi-ihminen.ogg}}

===Noun===
{{fi-noun}}

# A [[human being]].
# A [[person]].
# As a former part of compound (as the stem '''''ihmis-''''') signifying [[human]].

